  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Holistic emergency protection assistance for populations affected by the crisis/armed conflict of boko haram in the LAC province</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Protection, Assistance et Solutions</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Protection, Assistance et Solutions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Financement des abris et de la pr&#xe9;paration WASH avant la saison des cyclones.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">La fourniture d&apos;une protection efficace, d&apos;une assistance et de solutions durables aux r&#xe9;fugi&#xe9;s, aux personnes d&#xe9;plac&#xe9;es &#xe0; l&apos;int&#xe9;rieur de leur propre pays (PDI) et aux autres victimes de conflits et de catastrophes.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This award will provide financial support to intersos for a program entitled, holistic emergency protection assistance for populations affected by the crisis/armed conflict of boko haram in the LAC province in Chad. The proposed project goal is to ensure the most vulnerable and crisis affected populations are able to reduce the protection risks faced, through well coordinated protection and response services. The total number of beneficiaries that will be supported under this award is 43,521 individuals.</narrative>
  </description>
